# Global Constraints

All code must adhere to the canonical rules in `.agents/rules/`:
- **Core Principles**: See [.agents/rules/core-principles.md](../../.agents/rules/core-principles.md) (100% Localhost, 16ms SLA, $0 FOSS).
- **Anti-Overengineering**: See [.agents/rules/ponytail-minimalism.md](../../.agents/rules/ponytail-minimalism.md) (YAGNI, standard library first).
- **Process & TDD**: See [.agents/rules/superpowers-tdd.md](../../.agents/rules/superpowers-tdd.md) (Spec-first, red-green-refactor).
- **Visual Taste**: See [.agents/rules/ui-taste-principles.md](../../.agents/rules/ui-taste-principles.md) (1px borders, tight tracking, no blurry shadows).
